[{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_12000000_01_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_12000000_01_0010","text":"……那个……\n制作人大人……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_12000000_01_0020","text":"……凛世？\n怎么了？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_12000000_01_0030","text":"……那个……\n其实……——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_12000000_01_0040","text":"之前您交给我的……\n那份问卷……的事……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_12000000_01_0050","text":"啊，那本杂志的那个啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_12000000_01_0060","text":"嗯……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_12000000_01_0070","text":"那个……问卷……\n怎么都……填不出来……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_12000000_01_0080","text":"这样啊……\n是什么问题来着？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_12000000_01_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_12000000_01_0090","text":"……那种事……——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_12000000_01_0100","text":"……“理想的约会路线·前五名”……\n是……这样的问题……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_12000000_01_0110","text":"理想的约会路线，啊……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_12000000_01_0120","text":"……嗯，也不用那么苦恼吧，\n把凛世想去的地方老老实实写下来就好了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_12000000_01_0121","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_12000000_01_0130","text":"…………\n可是……凛世……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_12000000_01_0140","text":"……那个……只要能和……\n对方……在一起的话……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_12000000_01_0150","text":"去哪里……\n都可以……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_12000000_01_0160","text":"哈哈\n这么说也有道理"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_12000000_01_0211","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_12000000_01_0170","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_12000000_01_0180","text":"……那个……\n如果是制作人大人的话……会去哪里……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_12000000_01_0190","text":"嗯，约会路线的事？\n嗯——，让我想想……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_12000000_01_0200","text":"嗯，一般常见的地方嘛，\n咖啡店、电影院、水族馆之类的——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_12000000_01_0210","text":"啊，那个……\n不是问这个……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_12000000_01_0220","text":"？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_12000000_01_0230","text":"……那个……如果方便的话……\n想听听制作人大人的……前五名……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_12000000_01_0240","text":"我的前五名……？\n你问这个做什么？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_12000000_01_0250","text":"那是……\n那个……想作为参考……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_12000000_01_0260","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_12000000_01_0270","text":"……凛世，\n你是不是想照抄我的答案？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_12000000_01_0271","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_12000000_01_0280","text":"——！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_12000000_01_0290","text":"哈哈，果然\n不行哦，得自己好好想才行"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_12000000_01_0300","text":"不、不是的……\n凛世是……——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_12000000_01_0310","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_12000000_01_0320","text":"……那……\n至少……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_12000000_01_0330","text":"嗯？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_12000000_01_0340","text":"至少……\n第一名就好……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_12000000_01_0350","text":"凛世"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_12000000_01_0351","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_12000000_01_0360","text":"……抱歉\n不好意思，这个不能告诉你"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_12000000_01_0370","text":"给你一些思考的提示倒是可以，\n但最后一定要写上凛世自己想出来的答案"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_12000000_01_0380","text":"可、可是——……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_12000000_01_0390","text":"……不……好的……\n我知道了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_12000000_01_0391","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_12000000_01_0400","text":"…………\n小气……"}]
